## Summary

I built a production-grade native Apple (SwiftUI) parity of `web/src/components/feedback/JobProgressDrawer.tsx` at `apps/apple/TeslaSync/modals-dialogs/JobProgressDrawer.*` — the first surface of the new `modals-dialogs` tier.

**Delivered (11 files, ~2,060 Swift LOC):**
- **`.Adapter.swift`** — pure, dependency-free core: `ExportDrawerStatus/Kind/Job`, the drawer state machine (`JobDrawerPresentation`→`Visibility`), body-phase resolver, and faithful ports of web `formatBytes`/`formatRelative`.
- **`.Seams.swift`** — P1/S11 telemetry, P1/S10 strings facade, date facade, the `localStorage`→`UserDefaults` presentation store, the download action seam, and the P1/S8 `ExportDrawerJobsSource` (+ in-memory).
- **`.Model.swift`** — `@MainActor @Observable` model: buckets, presentation persistence, auto-promote, ambient auto-hide (with `pinned` modal suppression), stale auto-refresh, `view.opened` telemetry.
- **`.swift` / `.States.swift` / `.Rows.swift`** — every state rendered: minimized chip, header (Minimize/Dismiss), sections, rows (status icon, Download/failed), loading, empty, error+retry, inline error, stale/offline chip+banner. Full VoiceOver + Dynamic Type + reduce-motion.
- **`.Previews.swift`** (11 states), **`.strings`** (all web i18n keys + chrome), **`.Tests.swift`** + **`.ModelTests.swift`** (40 tests).

**Surface-acceptance gates — all green** (real output in the log): swiftformat `0/9`, swiftlint `--strict` `0 violations`, iOS-18 + macOS-15 Swift-6 typecheck `0/0`, isolated SwiftPM `40 tests, 0 failures`, placeholder `COUNT=0`, xcodegen valid + all 10 files enumerate. Surface is collision-free (0 external defs).

